Package: nvdastocks
Title: Explore the Risk and Return of NVIDIA Shares
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Duc", "Hoang", , "duchoang4113@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides daily NVIDIA (NVDA) share prices with moving averages and volatility, 
    a function that follows the value of an investment over a chosen period, 
    a Shiny app for exploring what an investor would have gained and how far the investment fell along the way.
